      tr: "<p>CS Fair 2026 – Bilkent University, Department of Computer Engineering – Senior Design Project Fair &amp; Award Ceremony. May 8, 2026, Friday, 13:00–17:30, Bilkent Hotel and Conference Center (afiş İngilizcedir).</p><p>Takım proje ödülleri: Sibel Özelçi Best Senior Design Award, Data Science Award, Demonstration Award, Innovation Award, Marketability Award, Mobile Award, Productivity Award, Social Impact Award, User Experience Award, Wide Impact Award.</p><p>Kişisel ödüller: Hacker Award, Team Worker Award, Entrepreneur Award, Theorist Award, Visual Designer Award, Gamer Award, Bookworm Award, Art Buff Award, Sportsperson Award, Night Owl Award, Humorist Award, Early Adopter Award, Traveler Award, Musician Award.</p><p>Ayrıca: Outstanding Teaching Assistant Award.</p><p>Sponsorlar: akdogan tech, Beko, Commencis, Bilkent Cyberpark, DataBoss, Deeployed, IBTECH, IOTIQ, Milsoft Forte, MobileAction, Oplog, Peak, teklifimgelsin, TÜBİTAK BİLGEM, VLMedia.</p>",
