  "/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/2412_global_turks_ai_panel.jpg": {
    alt: {en: "Poster of the Bilkent Alumni AInspiration Panel and photographs of the event (text version below)", tr: "Bilkent Alumni AInspiration Panel afişi ve etkinlik fotoğrafları (metin hali aşağıda)"},
    text: {
      en: "<p>Poster: Global Turks AI and Bilkent AI Society, “Bilkent Alumni AInspiration Panel”, December 5, 7 PM, with the AI Startup Factory (Y2F) logo. Panelists:</p><ul><li>Halit Akar (Azure OpenAI PM, Microsoft)</li><li>Beliz Gunel (AI Research Scientist, PhD, Google DeepMind)</li><li>Murat Arar (CV &amp; Deep Learning, PhD, NVIDIA)</li><li>Can Koyuncu (AI Engineer, PhD, Meta)</li><li>Sercan Arik (AI Research Scientist, PhD, Google)</li><li>Atila Orhon (Founder, AI Researcher, Argmax)</li><li>Turker Coskun (Product Director, C3.ai)</li><li>Mustafa Sakalsiz (Serial Founder, Peaka)</li><li>Gokhan Egri (AI Founder and CEO, Brainbase)</li><li>I. Zeki Yalniz (Research Scientist, PhD, Meta)</li><li>Beyza Ermis (Research Scientist, PhD, Cohere)</li><li>Murat Yesildal (Member of Technical Staff, OpenAI)</li></ul><p>Moderator: Ayhan Sebin (GenAI Research Incubation, IBM).</p><p>Below the poster: two photographs of the audience in an auditorium, and a video-call grid of the panelists who joined online.</p>",
      tr: "<p>Afiş: Global Turks AI ve Bilkent AI Society, “Bilkent Alumni AInspiration Panel”, 5 Aralık, 19.00; AI Startup Factory (Y2F) logosuyla. Panelistler (unvanlar afişteki gibi):</p><ul><li>Halit Akar (Azure OpenAI PM, Microsoft)</li><li>Beliz Gunel (AI Research Scientist, PhD, Google DeepMind)</li><li>Murat Arar (CV &amp; Deep Learning, PhD, NVIDIA)</li><li>Can Koyuncu (AI Engineer, PhD, Meta)</li><li>Sercan Arik (AI Research Scientist, PhD, Google)</li><li>Atila Orhon (Founder, AI Researcher, Argmax)</li><li>Turker Coskun (Product Director, C3.ai)</li><li>Mustafa Sakalsiz (Serial Founder, Peaka)</li><li>Gokhan Egri (AI Founder and CEO, Brainbase)</li><li>I. Zeki Yalniz (Research Scientist, PhD, Meta)</li><li>Beyza Ermis (Research Scientist, PhD, Cohere)</li><li>Murat Yesildal (Member of Technical Staff, OpenAI)</li></ul><p>Moderatör: Ayhan Sebin (GenAI Research Incubation, IBM).</p><p>Afişin altında: amfideki dinleyicilerin iki fotoğrafı ve çevrimiçi katılan panelistlerin görüntülü görüşme ekranı.</p>",
    },
  },
